	abstract = {The polymerase (pol) coding sequence was determined for 40 independent clinical cytomegalovirus isolates sensitive to ganciclovir and foscarnet. Sequence alignments showed {\textgreater}98\% interstrain homology and amino acid variation in only 4\% of the 1,237 codons. Almost all variation occurred outside of conserved functional domains where resistance mutations have been identified.},
